#: ../../../developer/services/admin-api.rst:785
#: 762b26adbaf64eb8b321cedbe48a5411
msgid ""
"``created-by-<QUBE_NAME>`` — Created in an extension to `qubesd` at the "
"moment of creation of the qube. The tag value cannot be changed via API, and "
"is also enforced by this extension."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/admin-api.rst:788
#: 430ba84cea124dab9344781053da44be
msgid ""
"``managed-by-<QUBE_NAME>`` — This tag is not created automatically, and the "
"tag value can be set and reset."
